ae46db3826ca609154e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Note that all three elves were casting using a #8d55ff#Tier 5#WHITE# #GOLD#combat stat#WHITE#, though they produced effects that varied in duration.\n\nIf you hadn't already deduced the rules governing these new status effects, hopefully this helped.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"注意，三个精灵施法时使用的都是 #8d55ff#层级 5#WHITE# 的 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE#，但产生的效果持续时间各不相同。\n\n如果你还没有推导出这些新状态效果的规则，希望这能帮到你。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4530b0b0f324d2e6b9d1664b2321c5e79705ced4959cb1163c8b9d56afcd8cef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a16108a691dc0bb12e9b3bf05e47d67c4aca4e006a394605b101d0ed950e8007","logical_entry_identity":"fe8f7325d48d0017da82b99ff7080acc160dda59036409e429931c9a71b069e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ASCII with background","source_tag":"_t","target":"带背景特效的字符界面"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6c2724f9ba4d76692f1ff2e84c08ffbd984e1ae385dc37ce79cdd5a50a3d114","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a1633bbf0a2cdd43b11a073eb80fc942b5472e993773510a899fc80f22dd9f6d","logical_entry_identity":"ba1fa9df33d7e7bb08110ccf745d8b97b647c7c541815183263f878a60d0794a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I am truly astonished by your strength; surviving that encounter was an epic feat.\nAs for the orcs, it is deeply troubling.  We have not seen any for eighty years... could they have come from the far east?\nAnyway, thank you again, @playername@, for your help.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的实力令我由衷惊叹；能在遭遇战中生还真是一项史诗般的壮举。\n至于兽人，这令人深感忧虑。我们已经有八十年没见过他们了……难道他们来自远东？\n无论如何，再次感谢你的帮助，@playername@。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2fd7d13bfe8758d08cebf8cde26d008d3f60dfbf96f15d0129e550e78f58b8fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a16a85bec9efacafb0bab41f55ba6cc7e50f69d0ee2f970ffdbb3bb83436a34f","logical_entry_identity":"415bc4d9edadac5d1c5d8c23d10806d5c7d1913123d819034308e9f1d6d7da75","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The air seems to freeze around the blade of t